@Skafetin.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7126

### Prijava - token iz odgovora koriste zahtjevi ispod.
# @name login
POST {{Skafetin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Skafetin1!"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### QR kod postojece opreme - ocekuje se 200 i PNG.
GET {{Skafetin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/equipment/1/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### QR kod nepostojece opreme - ocekuje se 404.
GET {{Skafetin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/equipment/999999/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bez tokena - ocekuje se 401.
GET {{Skafetin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/equipment/1/qr

###
